">け</span><span begin="0:46.967" end="0:47.127">出</span><span begin="0:47.127" end="0:47.567">し</span><span begin="0:47.567" end="0:47.987">て</span></p><p begin="0:48.400" end="0:51.580" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.400" end="0:49.020">何</span><span begin="0:49.020" end="0:49.210">も</span><span begin="0:49.210" end="0:49.550">か</span><span begin="0:49.550" end="0:49.910">も</span><span begin="0:49.910" end="0:50.180">置</span><span begin="0:50.180" end="0:50.620">い</span><span begin="0:50.620" end="0:51.180">てっ</span><span begin="0:51.180" end="0:51.580">て</span></p><p begin="0:51.969" end="0:56.899" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.969" end="0:52.659">素</span><span begin="0:52.659" end="0:53.209">直</span><span begin="0:53.489" end="0:54.049">に</span><span begin="0:54.049" end="0:54.669">笑</span><span begin="0:54.669" end="0:54.939">い</span><span begin="0:54.939" end="0:55.189">合</span><span begin="0:55.189" end="0:55.669">え</span><span begin="0:55.669" end="0:56.169">た</span><span begin="0:56.169" end="0:56.559">な</span><span begin="0:56.559" end="0:56.899">ら</span></p><p begin="0:59.486" end="1:01.406" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.486" end="1:00.216">そん</span><span begin="1:00.216" end="1:00.646">な</span><span begin="1:00.646" end="1:01.046">日</span><span begin="1:01.046" end="1:01.406">が</span></p><p begin="1:05.810" end="1:07.300" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.810" end="1:06.130">報</span><span begin="1:06.130" end="1:06.370">われ</span><span begin="1:06.370" end="1:06.560">た</span><span begin="1:06.560" end="1:06.700">いん</span><span begin="1:06.700" end="1:06.840">だ</span><span begin="1:06.840" end="1:07.030">と</span><span begin="1:07.030" end="1:07.300">か</span></p><p begin="1:07.297" end="1:09.227" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.297" end="1:07.677">救</span><span begin="1:07.677" end="1:07.817">わ</span><span begin="1:07.817" end="1:08.047">れ</span><span begin="1:08.047